      "normative_level": "DEFINITION",
      "category": "IMPLICIT_TRANSITION",
      "subject": "transaction",
      "stage": "sip_fsm",
      "description": "The UAC core MUST generate an ACK request for each 2xx received from the transaction layer. The ACK MUST be passed to the client transport every time a retransmission of the 2xx final response that triggered the ACK arrives.",
