      "category": "IMPLICIT_TRANSITION",
      "subject": "transaction",
      "stage": "sip_fsm",
      "description": "If the offer in the 2xx response is not acceptable, the UAC core MUST generate a valid answer in the ACK and then send a BYE immediately.",
